{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-01",
  "title": "坍塌",
  "storyCode": "0-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8b8994468f96153a71659461ca78f09aad654807f2f8bd92cb8719b6d80cc97c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可惡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "這裡，究竟怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這邊的屋子，也都給我搜乾淨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放開他......不！你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "反抗？太遲了！可恨的切爾諾伯格人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快跑！不要管我......孩子就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽......媽媽......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯軍警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別管平民！先把陣線守住！這些面具混蛋，人實在是太多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別讓軍警閒著！繼續打！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯軍警",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "增援怎麼還沒到！我們要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "上啊，上啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "怎麼回事......？！為什麼，為什麼整合運動會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "遮遮掩掩這麼多年，還是露出本性了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "感，感染者......在襲擊烏薩斯人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "為，為什麼！感染者這樣去騷擾烏薩斯政府的話，會死無葬身之地的......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不，他們的攻勢相當猛烈。這絕對是有預謀的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "之前我們救出博士的位置，相當機密......就連那裡都被他們滲入了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可能切爾諾伯格各處，都已經遭到了整合運動的襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "啊......這，怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "噓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還有逃脫的切爾諾伯格人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在搜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一個也別漏掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "切爾諾伯格的冷血動物......刻在我父輩身上的痛苦，這次，就讓我全都還給你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "（咳......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在那裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "（唔！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "（他，他們，發......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（安靜！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "（唔......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在這兒！找到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗚哇哇哇！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊！不，別......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "躲在巷子裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，啊啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "躲在那裡，就有用嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對，對不起！對不起啊！！至少，至少饒了我的兒子！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我們應該，立刻突襲整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我知道有風險，杜賓教官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只是，等這些整合運動解散後再行動......會耗費大量時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "何況，誰知道現在的狀況，會持續到什麼時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那麼，就應該迅速擊潰敵人並轉移。我說的，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "明白了，我服從你的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "各小組，聽好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "這些整合運動，還沒有意識到我們的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "記住，果斷、迅速地解決掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，調集隊伍吧，現在是你證明自己的時候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "現在的局勢，可不允許我們有所保留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "早就該交給我了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "簡單，我會輕鬆解決的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "呵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "阿米婭，看你的了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......“如果爭端能夠避免，那我們應當沉默——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "——如果戰鬥是必要的，那就戰鬥到最後！”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "羅德島的信念......從來沒有改變過！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
